    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d951">

                <pb facs="1071" n="1059" sameAs="frus:frus1943v03/pg1059"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">702.9411A/78</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Swedish Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Boström</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                        </hi><anchor n="87" xml:id="d951-f1"/>
                </head>
                <p>The Minister of Sweden in charge of the Japanese interests in the Territory of
                    Hawaii presents his compliments to the Honorable, the Secretary of State, and
                    has the honor to forward, herewith, copy of a cablegram from the Swedish
                    Ministry of Foreign Affairs concerning the complaints of the Japanese Government
                    regarding the treatment of the personnel of the former Japanese Consulate
                    General in Honolulu after the outbreak of the war on December 8, 1941.</p>
                <p>The Swedish Minister asks the Secretary of State to be good enough to give this
                    matter due consideration and to enable him to transmit the reply of the American
                    Government.</p>
                <p>The said cablegram also contains complaints concerning the treatment of Japanese
                    from Hawaii after their transportation to the mainland. That part of the message
                    has been sent, in copy, to the Spanish Embassy for consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-12-31">December 31,
                        1942</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/> No. B–113. </closer>


                <xi:include href="d951-a1.xml" xpointer="d951-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d951-f1" n="87" type="source" xml:id="d951-f1-content">
                <p>Handed on January 4, 1943, to Assistant Secretary Long by the Swedish Minister;
                    acknowledged by the Secretary of State on January 26.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
